<title>USA: Kentucky Housing Corp. $40 mln bond repriced.</title>
<headline>Kentucky Housing Corp. $40 mln bond repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. said Tuesday it repriced Kentucky Housing Corp.'s $40 million bond deal.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>KENTUCKY HOUSING CORPORATION HOUSING</p>
<p>RE: $40,000,000*</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
