<p>					     9,785,000*</p>
<p>			 FIXED RATE BONDS - 1997 SERIES A (NON-AMT)</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>		 (EXPECTED)	     (EXPECTED)</p>
<p>    DATED: 04/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 01/01 &amp; 07/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
